 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hmalpmkK8esQ7kNvwFRlb91&_nc_oc=AdpI8GrZ6klBHTEZ2JDB-zQVnt3n242neZ4JAICpmgioaDbGxfzHXa7nlBRmMeptp0w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQaqgOJMDRJhGABBLsmLSERrV3Nm2wgD-_vuiW_oy6nvg&oe=6AEF4141"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6ATgbQFWl5MQ7kNvwH1oTcn&_nc_oc=AdpaK4L4Kr9MsT-o5F39p6Yc6zGhC9X2sJ73JG5yLeHGtZiWaDpCJrThcCI04LyBR6Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRpK5pEF6X48X5ChkpetGmoPqBOiaOpCIWHW33pvl4iIA&oe=6AEF4EA6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cOvhnTJXUdQQ7kNvwFANG-H&_nc_oc=AdrrHORnkMQ94AXbwk6XP1b48IJVlufZ41iWcZJa4yzGCFSzNRMHRm7C6Z5iHuO85jg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTV6XUTq3WCFCtb9KDyPKm_mvO0VKfpdBpeqN0ZaEMaYg&oe=6AEF589C"}, {"fil